    pauseIndex: 0500000005000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Hey, $$you're finally up.
    displayText: Hey, you're finally up.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0500000005000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: You passed out. $$I cleared the last room for you. $$Want to talk about
      what happened?
    displayText: You passed out. I cleared the last room for you. Want to talk about
      what happened?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 10000000100000003100000031000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: No
    displayText: No
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.05
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Ok$.$.$.
    displayText: Ok...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ec1ce6e63321a941829a1566caac4f2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 020000000300000004000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It's fine.$.$. $$You can take your time.
    displayText: It's fine... You can take your time.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0a0000000b0000000d0000000d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I'm sorry.$.$. $$To be honest, $$I'm still not quite sure what happened.
      $$But it really looks like a part of my memory is missing.
    displayText: I'm sorry... To be honest, I'm still not quite sure what happened.
      But it really looks like a part of my memory is missing.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e23284570d4398b45acdfcf5a62324b6, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0a0000000b0000000d0000000d0000001b0000001b0000004300000043000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Let's talk about this later, $$right now we have to get out of here, $$yeh?
    displayText: Let's talk about this later, right now we have to get out of here,
      yeh?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1d0000001d0000004300000043000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: No.
    displayText: No.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e23284570d4398b45acdfcf5a62324b6, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.?
    displayText: ...?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Before we go clear this room, $$Maya, $$can I ask you something.$.$. $$Just
      to make sure.$.$.
    displayText: Before we go clear this room, Maya, can I ask you something... Just
      to make sure...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e00000024000000240000003c0000003d0000003f0000003f0000005100000052000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Uhhh yes.$.$.?
    displayText: Uhhh yes...?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 090000000a000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya. $$I know we knew each other for a long time, $$right? $$But I can't
      really recall the first time we met.
    displayText: Maya. I know we knew each other for a long time, right? But I can't
      really recall the first time we met.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 060000000600000031000000310000003800000038000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I tried to find memories with you in it, $$but none of them is older than
      a few years, $$despite the feeling that we've been together for a long time.
    displayText: I tried to find memories with you in it, but none of them is older
      than a few years, despite the feeling that we've been together for a long time.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 29000000290000005500000055000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya$.$.$. $$Do you remember the first time we met$.$.$.$?
    displayText: Maya... Do you remember the first time we met...?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 04000000050000000600000008000000080000002d0000002e0000002f00000030000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Uh.$.$. $$Well.$.$. $$My memory isn't that good either. $$So I don't know.$.$.
    displayText: Uh... Well... My memory isn't that good either. So I don't know...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e7de67e2d95a03d4b82bb6e2e759966a, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.027
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 030000000400000006000000060000000b0000000c0000000e0000000e00000030000000300000004000000041000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: But our relationship right now is good right? $$What's the point of asking
      that.$.$.?
    displayText: But our relationship right now is good right? What's the point of
      asking that...?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b4e91975d53cca641b0139806b4b5627, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.027
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2e0000002e0000004e0000004f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: You are panicking.
    displayText: You are panicking.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.05
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I.$.$. $$I wasn't panicking.$.$. $$It was just so scary here.$.$. $$Look,
      $$there's eyes everywhere, $$you see?
    displayText: I... I wasn't panicking... It was just so scary here... Look, there's
      eyes everywhere, you see?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.027
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0200000003000000050000000500000018000000190000001b0000001b000000350000003600000038000000380000003e0000003e0000005700000057000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 708777bab44cd2f45b2812ba56f77be9, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.12
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Okay. $$Fine. $$Let's get out of this room.$.$.
    displayText: Okay. Fine. Let's get out of this room...
